      <description>&lt;p&gt;Blockchain &amp;amp; Backend Engineer — I build serious infrastructure, not demos.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m a blockchain and backend engineer with 4 years in web3 and 2 years building backend systems. I work primarily in &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Solidity&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;/strong&gt; — focused on protocol architecture, smart contract engineering, and large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-do&#34;&gt;&#xA;  What I Do&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#what-i-do&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; — Large-scale system design in Go. APIs, distributed systems, high-throughput infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Contract Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; — Solidity and Rust. Protocol design, DeFi mechanics, on-chain systems.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blockchain Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; — Deep research and implementation across modern DeFi and cross-chain architectures.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;tech-stack&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Tech Stack&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#tech-stack&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Go&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;Solidity&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;Rust&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;SVM/EVM&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;Foundry&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;Docker&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;Kafka&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;RabbitMQ&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;TypeScript&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;NestJS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
